                                    <TextBlock Text="Zero-Beat Live Migration: Migrates the entire active queue, current singer, up-next singer, rotation start anchor, round checkmarks (rounds 1-10), tonight's performance history with original timestamps, pending patron requests, and venue/DJ branding." Margin="10,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
