                                    <TextBlock Text="Automated In-App Remote DJ Transition: When the laptop pulls the session, the tablet automatically flips into an embedded full-screen Remote DJ controller (dj.html). The tablet securely receives the laptop's IP, port, and DJ PIN, auto-authenticating so the DJ never leaves the app." Margin="10,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
