                                    <TextBlock Text="1-Click Wi-Fi Discovery: The 'Scan Wi-Fi' feature sweeps the local venue subnet in 1 second to find running instances on port 5000. Selecting a discovered peer auto-populates the host address and focuses the DJ PIN field for instant entry." Margin="10,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                </BulletDecorator>
