                                    <TextBlock Text="Deep Linking &amp; QR Portal: A dedicated Switch Device QR code points to http://&lt;ip&gt;:5000/handoff. Scanning with a mobile camera opens a themed portal with a 1-tap 'Open in KSRotation MAUI' deep link (ksrotation://handoff)." Margin="10,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                </BulletDecorator>
